Modifications and additions contributed in this fork are made available under
the same Eclipse Public License, Version 1.0, in accordance with the terms of
that license.

Summary of changes made in this fork relative to the upstream project:

  Platform upgrade
    - Eclipse target platform moved from 2020-03 to 2026-06
    - Xtext 2.21.0 -> 2.43.0, Tycho 1.6.0 -> 5.0.3, MWE2 2.11.2 -> 2.26.0
    - Java 8 -> Java 25; all bundles now require execution environment JavaSE-25
    - All modules unified at version 2.0.0

  Build and packaging fixes
    - org.agileware.natural.common: bin.includes was missing "." so the bundle
      shipped no compiled classes
    - org.agileware.natural.cucumber.ui: org.eclipse.xtext.ui.codemining changed
      from an optional package import to a required bundle
    - Features updated to include the .ide bundles they depend on
    - org.agileware.natural.testing: corrected the bundled Hamcrest jar and
      added the missing Bundle-ClassPath

  Step definition navigation (org.agileware.natural.common,
  org.agileware.natural.cucumber.ui)
    - JavaAnnotationMatcher: made the step definition cache thread safe and
      added lazy JDT change listener registration for cache invalidation
    - JavaAnnotationMatcher: hardened against annotations without a value and
      against annotation values that are not valid regular expressions
    - CucumberHyperlinkHelper: fixed unmodifiable result list and made the
      node model traversal null safe

  JBehave grammar (org.agileware.natural.jbehave)
    - Corrected the nullable EOL terminal
    - Added Lifecycle, Before, After, Scope and Outcome rules
    - Added the "So that" narrative form
    - Made Story scenarios and Scenario descriptions optional
    - Tag values and newline handling after section keywords

  Web modules (org.agileware.natural.cucumber.web,
  org.agileware.natural.jbehave.web)
    - Migrated from javax.servlet to jakarta.servlet
    - Migrated from Jetty 9 to Jetty 12 (org.eclipse.jetty.ee10)


